  "contentHtml": "<p>다음 앱으로 꽃검색이 가능합니다.</p><p><br></p><p>저도&nbsp;즐겨 해보고 있는데요.</p><p>정확도가 높습니다~&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://media.daum.net/digital/internet/newsview?newsid=20160530184204719\">http://media.daum.net/digital/internet/newsview?newsid=20160530184204719</a></p><p><br></p><p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>선생님 이 꽃 이름이 뭐예요?</p><p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; language: ko; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: white; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\">이 꽃은 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; language: en-US; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: white; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\">‘</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; language: ko; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: white; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\">자목련</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; language: en-US; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: white; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\">’</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; language: ko; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: white; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\">이라고 하지</span><span style=\"color: white; font-family: Constantia; font-size: 28pt; language: en-US; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: white; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">….</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: white; font-family: Constantia; font-size: 28pt; language: en-US; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: