lim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; language: ko; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: white; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\">인공지능이 꽃 이름을 검색해주는 세상</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; language: ko; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: white; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\">인공지능이 지식을 소유하고 지식을 전달해준다</span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; language: en-US; mso-color-index: 1; mso-ascii-font-family: Constantia; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: white; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\">.</span></p><div style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -0.3in; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; unicode-bidi: embed; direction: ltr; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; language: e